  "bio": "Mari Milhomem is a dedicated tattoo artist from Anápolis, Brazil, whose expertise lies in illustrative and fineline tattoos. While Mari is still at the beginning stages of their tattooing career, their work showcases a strong foundation in blackwork and boldline techniques, reflective of high professional standards and a promise of growing excellence. Clients visiting Fractal Tattoo Studio can expect to witness Mari's commitment to professionalism in every piece they create.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Anápolis, Goias, Brazil",
